{"summary":"Help cats get to sleep in this adorable puzzle game.","description":"NYAN NYAN PLAZA UPDATE\n\nThe cats are playing at Nyan Nyan Plaza - a neon-filled retro arcade featuring gachapon machines.\n\nNew Levels\nThere are 40 new levels to solve in this new arcade-themed world.\n\nNew Cat\nStuffie joins the cast as Nekograms' first soft-toy cat.\n\nNew Accessories\nKeep an eye out for three new accessories: Gachapon ball, Game heart (pixel-art style), Claw machine hat\n\nNew Music\nPuzzle along with a new arcade-inspired music track.\n\n---\n\nHelp cats get to sleep in this adorable game, with novel mechanics based on nonograms and sliding puzzles. Nekograms is easy to learn but does get challenging!\n\nGET THE CATS TO SLEEP\n\nCats only sleep on cushions. Complete a level by helping all cats get to sleep.\n\nCOLLECT ALL THE STARS\n\nEarn stars by completing levels in the fewest number of moves. Achieve 3 stars in every level.\n\nUNLOCK ENDLESS MODE\n\nComplete the game to unlock Endless Mode and ascend through different states of cat consciousness.\n\nFEATURES\n\n- Original puzzle mechanics\n- 160 levels over 4 unique worlds\n- Over 15 different cat breeds\n- Original soundtrack\n- Endless Mode","esrbNotes":null,"pegiNotes":null,"iapPrices":null,"video":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/OQFOYp9LLC8?vq=large&rel=0&autohide=1&showinfo=0","header":"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Lc25eatSmBKeErqSWyrBM5ns366277pf7t8yKOGCTXUrys-6LzTAvr1IvZtC4-7trZ4SmJF8Qfes0PaLo8dE","screenshots":["https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/lFFEYnS9kabeb_WX42gXegTQkul-pZftRNS90gsXsxxaB7mPuujAxNxlMHos1F4v5bSUjwnR_uXU9mrpE-iI","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/w0-BYZohQEQdBYKuCTUQmTNbwhHt1ZOoyv1uDTqikSW7gqy4w7PIWVdiLnrSpHY-Kpu2wOBtFgciW4QNpopA","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/EMyHIP-Nf1c4SjlH_QgBsGYwIP2rs17bn1Df1PjsP5KMip3S1erAZqNyUPgyXS4gM1e1sHDuVw8iiC8i2lbkxA","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/4EmuYfabdzG03PL-KalRe-NISw8cmZFENLGlie2LA5aKsDSr5nFvlDpI7RbZIS98zyE_4f3i